SUB pdfSetRise (r AS SINGLE)
  '_pdf_)
  '_pdf_@F1,14W60L16
  '_pdf_T
  '_pdf_T Text rise specifies the distance, in unscaled text space units, to move the baseline up or down from its default location.

  '_pdf_T
  '_pdf_@F2,14W60L16TParameters
  '_pdf_@F1,14W60L16T
  '_pdf_T   r - Amount of rise (+/-)
  '_pdf_T
  '_pdf_@F2,14W60L16TReturns
  '_pdf_@F1,14W60L16T
  '_pdf_T   Nothing.
  '_pdf_T
  '_pdf_@F2,14W60L16TExample
